[RUNNING]● Message: Broadened QA/test documentation and stabilized data governance + tenant tooling.

- Added module inventory, profile matrix, and the full QA playbook so the build/coverage expectations are explicit (`README.md:183`, `docs/quality/test_strategy.md:1`).
- Enforced Spotless during `verify` and wired profile-aware DB/test toggles plus backup defaults for local + CI usage (`pom.xml:158`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/application.properties:10`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/resources/application.properties:1`).
- Introduced a local filesystem backup client and safer product/location defaults to prevent JSON/title issues while adding backup configuration (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/backup/LocalBackupStorageClient.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/Product.java:176`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/InventoryLocation.java:82`).
- Re-cut Flyway migrations for governance/compliance/shipping artifacts and removed misleading down scripts (`modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/V20260123__compliance_privacy_tables.sql:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/resources/db/migrations/V20260124__feature_flag_governance.sql:1`).
- Hardened tenant/RLS tests with a shared data cleaner, Postgres profile/resource tweaks, and H2-friendly assumptions to keep isolation checks reliable (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/testsupport/TestDataCleaner.java:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/tenant/TenantFilterTest.java:21`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/testsupport/PostgresTenantTestResource.java:20`, `modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/PaymentJobServiceTest.java:1`).

